{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14211260","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14211260","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1421126001:1":{"text":"最初は戦闘試験よ。武器を使うも使わないも自由。","source_cn":"首先就是格斗测试了，徒手或者带武器都行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EA232924399C0E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421126002:1":{"text":"当時は入れ替わり戦だったの。相手もサリエ様自ら選んだ戦士たちだったわ。","source_cn":"当年是车轮战，而且是沙利叶大人亲自安排的战士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C3BD09DC1B022A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1421126002":{"text":"当時は入れ替わり戦だったの。相手もサリエ様自ら選んだ戦士たちだったわ。","source_cn":"当年是车轮战，而且是沙利叶大人亲自安排的战士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C3BD09DC1B022A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421126003:1":{"text":"そうよ。最も過酷で残酷な入隊試験よ。","source_cn":"是啊，要不是这样，也不会说是最严格甚至残酷的测试。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x282CF9BDD2F0C00F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"そうよ。最も過酷で残酷な入隊試験よ。","female":"そうよ。最も過酷で残酷な入隊試験よ。","variant_male_record_index":"164341","variant_female_record_index":"164342","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421126005:1":{"text":"当時は相手を殺してもかまわなかったの。だから試験に挑んだ平民たちは、最初の一戦で大勢が命を落としたわ……","source_cn":"当时的战斗是生死不论，所以来参加测试的平民，第一轮就死...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AC5EC22B902C5C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male